## B-API-01 — PublishedScheduleDTO

发布给：C/D/学生课表消费者。

最小字段：

```json
{
  "termId": 1,
  "scopeKey": "SCHOOL|COLLEGE:10|CLASS:20",
  "activeBatchId": 100,
  "scopeHeadVersion": 3,
  "publishedAt": "2026-09-01T08:00:00+08:00",
  "items": [
    {
      "taskId": 2001,
      "weekday": 1,
      "slotId": "0102",
      "startWeek": 1,
      "endWeek": 16,
      "parity": "ALL",
      "classroomId": 301,
      "teacherIds": [501],
